# Started by hand (ssh, a script): no launcher contract and no input.state. The app sizes itself from the layout
# service and works.
title Started without the launcher
nocontract
sizes 640x480 320x480
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.886392,2.27417,15

wait 1200
shot map-nocontract
key tab
wait 600
shot sources-nocontract
key esc
expect quit
